@startuml pipeline
title PrintScript - Interacción entre componentes

skinparam componentStyle uml2

file "archivo .ps" as source

component "Lexer" as lexer
component "Parser" as parser
component "Interpreter" as interpreter
component "Analyzer" as analyzer
component "Formatter" as formatter

interface "Iterator<Result<Token>>" as tokens
interface "Iterator<Result<Statement>>" as statements
interface "Iterator<Result<Statement>>" as executed

source --> lexer : Reader\n(línea a línea)

lexer -- tokens
parser --( tokens
parser -- statements
interpreter --( statements
interpreter -- executed
analyzer --( executed

formatter --( tokens

interpreter ..> "salida del programa" : println
formatter ..> "código formateado"

note bottom of statements
  Cada etapa pide el siguiente elemento a la anterior:
  el archivo nunca se carga completo en memoria.
  Los errores viajan como Failure(Diagnostic), no como excepciones.
end note

@enduml
